+# NPM_DIR/SHA256SUMS.txt (one line per tarball NAME, replaced in place on a
+# rebuild) and in the per-tarball sidecar `<tarball>.sha256` written further
+# down. Both use the `<64-hex>  <filename>` form checksum tools consume.
 #
-# Format is `<64-hex>  <filename>` — compatible with `sha256sum -c` so a
