  1077	    ```yaml fence specifically (validate-pair-rail-verdict.py); the guard used
  1078	    to enter the first fence of ANY language, so a verdict with a leading
  1079	    non-yaml fence (a quoted transcript, say) parsed as EMPTY here while the
