  1192	# mirrored copy of `.claude/**` + `scripts/**` (the publish staging rsync, and
  1193	# any local `install-npm.sh` run), so a directory root would have the scanner
  1194	# auditing clones of this repo — slow, and every hit a duplicate of a hit it
  1195	# already reported. `RELEASE.md` is the precedent: this tuple takes files.
  1196	SCAN_ROOTS = (
