  1237	    where the driver MUST be ahead of it: the moment TARGET_BASE is set for the
  1238	    next release and `bump` has not run yet. A gate that blocks the documented
  1239	    path is the failure mode this plan exists to close, not a new instance."""
  1240	    text = DRIVER_SRC.read_text(encoding="utf-8")
  1241	    m = re.search(r'(?m)^TARGET_BASE="(\d+\.\d+\.\d+)"$', text)
