  1748	    npm/INTEGRITY.md except a Contract table row or §Not yet automated. Where
  1749	    the earlier gates ask "is this row honest?", this one asks "is this claim
  1750	    even standing somewhere that can be checked?" — the question the file
  1751	    failed on the day it shipped."""
  1752	    doc = INTEGRITY_DOC.read_text(encoding="utf-8")
  1753	    assert _ENFORCEMENT_VOCAB, "the vocabulary is empty; the sweep checks nothing"
